{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54553","headline":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伏兵气，浑浑又能圆。\n黑（京本作「赤」）气中间环赤色（辛本、川本作「色」，京本作「含黑气」），又如赤杵黑霞连（京本作「边」），其下立戈鋋。\n（状如赤杵在黑气中[也]）（据京本补）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54553.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54553","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}